{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "123f74a510a20eddc443a4c0d865beb13e689de578aadb2db546f8914db2beca", "ja": "（今日は、杏奈達の新曲のPV撮影だ。\nそろそろリハーサルの時間だけど……）", "zh": "（今天是杏奈她们拍摄新歌PV的日子。\n差不多该进行彩排了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1001_p", "source_sha256": "58874c5dfa4beaa813eeae0ced2da581e685391bb8678aa24951c7b32be3a185", "ja": "杏奈、お疲れ様。\n調子はどうだ？", "zh": "杏奈，辛苦了。\n状态怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "2e48db1e96be5fe7b6878b2c4cee407466b14adb1cef2bf2c627c949f535de20", "ja": "ん……。レッスン、たくさん、したから……\n大丈夫……だと、思います……。", "zh": "嗯……因为做了很多训练……\n我觉得……应该没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1003_p", "source_sha256": "248a9e73100539b84d0029acf8471970be9752822db10359df45b17e9cb75301", "ja": "そうか。今日は街中でのロケだから、\n駅前や広場で踊ってた日を思い出すな。", "zh": "这样啊。今天是在街头取景拍摄，让我想起了在车站前和广场上跳舞的那段日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "89c8cc21ae1b6eb6531e397328374eab4cd28325ddaa7a2a40fab6cf495ebcf6", "ja": "ん……。チアダンス、難しかった、けど……\n楽しかった、よ……。", "zh": "嗯……啦啦队舞，很难……但是……很开心……哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "9a52ab05f9b68050feba9b3e21ad3e72c4acd94d9367f51afd1867966326ae78", "ja": "杏奈の応援で……パワー、もらったって……\nみんなが……。杏奈、うれしかった……。", "zh": "大家都说……从杏奈的加油中……获得了力量……杏奈很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "fc13547794141395f91fa6a2364229c27eb1a3719c3a6e75f88755a1862f68d7", "ja": "杏奈の、応援……ちゃんと届いた、って……。", "zh": "大家都说……杏奈的加油，确实传达到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c9a54c75cd710de52580e0d5e851fe2b388827a8adccbeaf31c729d4f683c567", "ja": "ああ。きっと大勢の人達が、\n杏奈の応援で元気づけられたと思うぞ。", "zh": "嗯。我想一定有很多人，都因为杏奈的加油而打起了精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "271cdda3629c909b1bce5274cde67ddb78ce8528458af0a4709d28f3e8f7e69d", "ja": "杏奈……いつもは、応援もらってる、けど……\n応援するのも、いいね……。", "zh": "杏奈……平时总是得到大家的支持，但是……\n为别人加油，也很不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "346c43c87e814a9eb3905422f3cfe2204b167ad45af2bb22883c66e5a2316215", "ja": "応援した人が……笑顔になってくれると……\n杏奈……うれしい、です……♪", "zh": "为之加油的人……能露出笑容的话……\n杏奈……也会很开心、的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1010d7af89a1a7bcd25f648761675f2cf980c0211a1c30cd184b90ff629de5bf", "ja": "それが一番うれしいよな。相手が笑ってくれると、\n自分もまた頑張ろうと思えるし。", "zh": "那是最让人开心的。看到对方露出笑容，自己也会想着要继续努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "653f7f26171c74b7f5e29015e1d2cfb0999eddf3cf97f60f736f7208d2d6b4a2", "ja": "うん……。みんなが、笑顔だったから……\n杏奈……最後まで、頑張れた……よ。", "zh": "嗯……因为大家都在笑……杏奈……才能努力到最后……哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "c84fb96427891876d98e9d2cbdf8c05fede056e3b4994fef556a8e92bf75d8cb", "ja": "杏奈のこと、いつも応援してくれる……みんな……\nチアを、見てくれたみんなにも……。", "zh": "一直为杏奈加油的……大家……\n还有来看啦啦队表演的大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "b9a6b07f2a37cb52e0d427f3b92541189e7154b67003777cb35bf2237d0fdec0", "ja": "PV、見てほしい……です。\n見てくれる……かな……。", "zh": "希望他们……能看PV。\n大家会……看吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1014_p", "source_sha256": "82124324847573abc172fc443e3096c5383d475e0c3a98197401ea995b3c8f00", "ja": "きっと、どこかで見ていてくれるよ。だからPVでも、\n杏奈の笑顔で、見てくれる人達みんなを元気にしよう！", "zh": "他一定会在某个地方看着我们的。所以，就算是在PV里，也要用杏奈的笑容让所有观看的人都打起精神来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0283_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "b35f42c27a3fd25106ad3d3fce40ce2b9165f0f6c7d86ff773085060a84eeb00", "ja": "うん……わかった。……杏奈、今までで、\n一番の笑顔で……みんなを、応援……します……！", "zh": "嗯……知道了。……杏奈会用至今为止最灿烂的笑容……为大家加油……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
